      "text": "Women 40+: if your skin is red, tight, or burning, try fewer products for two weeks. One gentle cleanser. One rich cream. My reset is RIMAN at night — barrier first, glow second. Who's stripping back with me? #SkinBarrier #MenopauseSkin",
