        "skin barrier"
      ],
      "text": "November tip for dry, menopause skin: cream goes on while your face is still damp. Water + cream = seal. I press RIMAN night cream in, don't rub. Tightness drops by morning. Try it tonight. #WinterDryness #DrySkin",
