      "intent_url": "https://x.com/intent/post?text=November%20tip%20for%20dry%2C%20menopause%20skin%3A%20cream%20goes%20on%20while%20your%20face%20is%20still%20damp.%20Water%20%2B%20cream%20%3D%20seal.%20I%20press%20RIMAN%20night%20cream%20in%2C%20don%27t%20rub.%20Tightness%20drops%20by%20morning.%20Try%20it%20tonight.%20%23WinterDryness%20%23DrySkin"
    },
    {
      "topic": "one night cream gift",
      "keywords": [
